proxmox-backup-client (4.2.0-0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add s390x architecture support. s390x is big-endian; the pxar and
    datastore on-disk/on-wire formats are little-endian by design, so
    backups are cross-architecture compatible. Add the s390x pbs-buildcfg
    multiarch mapping.

 -- Ciro Iriarte <ciro.iriarte+software@gmail.com>  Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000

proxmox-backup-client (4.2.0-0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add binary package architecture support for armhf and ppc64el.
  * Patch bundled upstream sources for 32-bit libc::time_t, ARM32
    libc field widths including fuse-loop and pbs-client pxar
    create/extract/metadata stat/offset conversions, and ppc64le
    pbs-buildcfg multiarch detection.

 -- Ciro Iriarte <ciro.iriarte+software@gmail.com>  Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

proxmox-backup-client (4.2.0-0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial community/unofficial packaging of the Proxmox Backup client suite
    (proxmox-backup-client, pxar, proxmox-file-restore) built from upstream
    Rust sources at tag v4.2.0.
  * File-level restore only; VM/block-image restore path is out of scope.

 -- Ciro Iriarte <ciro.iriarte+software@gmail.com>  Fri, 08 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
